    "id": 563036,
    "title": "SIME 2026",
    "description": "<div id=\"section1\" class=\"text-section\"></div>\r\n<div id=\"section2\" class=\"text-section active\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1b82cf7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"1b82cf7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<h1 class=\"title\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>IEEE International Conference on Smart Innovations for Medicine and Engineering (SIME 2026)</strong></h1>\r\n<h1 class=\"title\" style=\"text-align: center;\">November 2-4, 2026, Sousse, Tunisia</h1>\r\n<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">\r\n<p><strong>IEEE SIME 2026 &ndash; EXTENDED CALL FOR PAPERS</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Dates:</strong>&nbsp;02&ndash;04 November 2026<br><strong>Location:</strong>&nbsp;Sousse, Tunisia<br><strong>IEEE Co-Sponsored</strong>&nbsp;| Proceedings to be published in IEEE Xplore&reg;</p>\r\n<p>The Organizing Committee invites researchers, academics, and industry professionals to submit original papers and propose Special Sessions.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><img class=\"an1\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/17.0/1f4c5/72.png\" alt=\"📅\" loading=\"lazy\" data-emoji=\"📅\" aria-label=\"📅\">&nbsp;KEY DATES (EXTENDED)</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Special Session Proposal:&nbsp;<strong>15 June 2026</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Paper Submission (Regular &amp; Special Sessions):&nbsp;<strong>21 July 2026</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Special Session Paper Submission:&nbsp;<strong>15 July 2026</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Notification of Acceptance:&nbsp;<strong>01 August 2026</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Regular Registration:&nbsp;<strong>01 October 2026</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Conference Dates:&nbsp;<strong>02&ndash;04 November 2026</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr>\r\n<p><strong><img class=\"an1\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/17.0/1f4d1/72.png\" alt=\"📑\" width=\"38\" height=\"38\" loading=\"lazy\" data-emoji=\"📑\" aria-label=\"📑\">&nbsp;CONFERENCE TRACKS</strong></p>\r\n<ol start=\"1\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Advanced Medical Imaging, Diagnostics &amp; Therapeutics</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Artificial Intelligence, Data Analytics &amp; Computer Vision</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Biotechnology, Personalized Medicine &amp; Smart Health Solutions</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Control, Automation &amp; Intelligent Diagnostics</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Green, Renewable &amp; Sustainable Technologies</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>IoT, Embedded Systems and Robotics</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p><strong><img class=\"an1\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/17.0/1f9e9/72.png\" alt=\"🧩\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" loading=\"lazy\" data-emoji=\"🧩\" aria-label=\"🧩\">&nbsp;SPECIAL SESSIONS</strong></p>\r\n<p>Propose a focused session on emerging topics.<br><img class=\"an1\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/17.0/2705/72.png\" alt=\"✅\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" loading=\"lazy\" data-emoji=\"✅\" aria-label=\"✅\">&nbsp;Organizers of Special Sessions with&nbsp;<strong>at least 5 accepted papers</strong>&nbsp;receive&nbsp;<strong>one full free registration + accommodation</strong>.<br><img class=\"an1\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/17.0/1f4cc/72.png\" alt=\"📌\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" loading=\"lazy\" data-emoji=\"📌\" aria-label=\"📌\">&nbsp;Extended proposal deadline:&nbsp;<strong>15 June 2026</strong><br><img class=\"an1\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/17.0/1f517/72.png\" alt=\"🔗\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" loading=\"lazy\" data-emoji=\"🔗\" aria-label=\"🔗\">&nbsp;More details:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://sime-conf.org/special-sessions/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://sime-conf.org/special-sessions/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1781121754999000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3WI2QZMseaDwDA9d7jjkCG\">https://sime-conf.org/special-<wbr>sessions/</a></p>\r\n<p><strong><img class=\"an1\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/17.0/1f4ce/72.png\" alt=\"📎\" width=\"43\" height=\"43\" loading=\"lazy\" data-emoji=\"📎\" aria-label=\"📎\">&nbsp;ATTACHMENTS &amp; QUICK LINKS</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Conference website:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://sime-conf.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://sime-conf.org/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1781121754999000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1msik1_5Vtbwd6P5VjFidC\">https://sime-conf.org/</a></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Download CFP (PDF):&nbsp;<a href=\"https://sime-conf.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/CFP_SIME_2026_EXTENDED-DEADLINE.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://sime-conf.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/CFP_SIME_2026_EXTENDED-DEADLINE.pdf&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1781121754999000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2YCMEJFCZ6wDXcRWT6XOBm\">https://sime-conf.org/wp-<wbr>content/uploads/2026/06/CFP_<wbr>SIME_2026_EXTENDED-DEADLINE.<wbr>pdf</a></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Paper submission:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://sime-conf.org/submission/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://sime-conf.org/submission/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1781121754999000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1Ivah11gyQZ6_VvD0jiidk\">https://sime-conf.org/<wbr>submission/</a></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Registration:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://sime-conf.org/registration/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://sime-conf.org/registration/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1781121754999000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0rQdRbKF8nZr7wK496_Qim\">https://sime-conf.org/<wbr>registration/</a></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Special Sessions:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://sime-conf.org/special-sessions/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://sime-conf.org/special-sessions/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1781121754999000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3WI2QZMseaDwDA9d7jjkCG\">https://sime-conf.org/special-<wbr>sessions/</a></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>SIBE 2026 Symposium:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://sime-conf.org/symposium/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://sime-conf.org/symposium/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1781121755000000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1gTfxTdPOFt5uIgDOCRzmK\">https://sime-conf.org/<wbr>symposium/</a></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr>\r\n<p><strong><img class=\"an1\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/17.0/1f4f1/72.png\" alt=\"📱\" width=\"53\" height=\"53\" loading=\"lazy\" data-emoji=\"📱\" aria-label=\"📱\">&nbsp;FOLLOW &amp; SHARE</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Facebook:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61581917480864\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id%3D61581917480864&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1781121755000000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0gwhhBkUURcTFxXGvQxrKF\">https://www.facebook.com/<wbr>profile.php?id=61581917480864</a></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>LinkedIn:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/sime-2026\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.linkedin.com/company/sime-2026&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1781121755000000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3ITV06QsMbzz8ccmbOpZUk\">https://www.linkedin.com/<wbr>company/sime-2026</a></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>For any inquiries, please contact us at:&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"mailto:sime.conf@gmail.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">sime.conf@gmail.com</a></strong></p>\r\n<p>We look forward to welcoming you to Sousse!</p>\r\n<p><strong>IEEE SIME 2026 Organizing Committee<br></strong><strong><img class=\"an1\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/17.0/1f4e7/72.png\" alt=\"📧\" width=\"43\" height=\"43\" loading=\"lazy\" data-emoji=\"📧\" aria-label=\"📧\">&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:sime.conf@gmail.com\">sime.conf@gmail.com</a></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>",
